# Allow-list for scripts/check-scribeink-identity.sh
# Format: <path-glob><TAB><literal substring>
#   A FAIL is suppressed when the file matches the glob AND the offending line
#   (or, for xcstrings, the offending string) contains the literal.
#   A bare <path-glob> with no literal exempts the whole file.
# Globs use shell `case` matching, so `*` also crosses `/`.

# Whole-file exemptions
LICENSE
docs/*

